{"id":"n31695-1-9","stage":4,"title":"전통문화 · 传统文化","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31695-1-9-1","ko":"나는 전통 방식으로 결혼식을 하려고.","zh":"我打算用传统方式举办婚礼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전통","meaning":"传统","explanation":"전통：传统","readings":[{"term":"전통","audio":"/audio/c4b267a6b5c6a012a989.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70841","senseId":"1","lemma":"전통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방식으로","meaning":"方式","explanation":"방식：方式；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"방식","audio":"/audio/3f5e5497216f63d32822.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15893","senseId":"1","lemma":"방식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결혼식을","meaning":"婚礼","explanation":"결혼식：婚礼；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결혼식","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31666","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하려고.","meaning":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；려고：非敬语地表达打算，或根据语调询问意图。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c4b267a6b5c6a012","term":"전통","zh":"传统","audio":"/audio/c4b267a6b5c6a012a989.mp3","entryId":"70841","definition":"某集团或共同体中，从上一时代开始传下来的固有的思想、习惯、行为等样式。","pronunciation":["전통"]},{"id":"3f5e5497216f63d3","term":"방식","zh":"方式","audio":"/audio/3f5e5497216f63d32822.mp3","entryId":"15893","definition":"一定的方法或形式。","pronunciation":["방식"]},{"id":"95cfb1a60ed967ea","term":"결혼식","zh":"婚礼","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3","entryId":"31666","definition":"宣告成人男女成为法定夫妻的仪式。","pronunciation":["결혼식"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/23d67318e531694e12bc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31695-1-9-2","ko":"너는 정말 우리 전통문화를 아끼고 좋아하는구나.","zh":"你真的很重视并喜爱我们的传统文化啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전통문화를","meaning":"传统文化","explanation":"전통문화：传统文化；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전통문화","audio":"/audio/e80f80e1a21831534a9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31695","senseId":"1","lemma":"전통문화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아끼고","meaning":"爱惜，珍惜","explanation":"아끼다：爱惜，珍惜；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아끼다","audio":"/audio/f72efea0664035d04563.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24445","senseId":"2","lemma":"아끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하는구나.","meaning":"喜欢，喜爱","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢，喜爱；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"2","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"e80f80e1a2183153","term":"전통문화","zh":"传统文化","audio":"/audio/e80f80e1a21831534a9b.mp3","entryId":"31695","definition":"该国家中产生流传下来的该国的固有文化。","pronunciation":["전통문화"]},{"id":"f72efea0664035d0","term":"아끼다","zh":"爱惜，珍惜","audio":"/audio/f72efea0664035d04563.mp3","entryId":"24445","definition":"重视而照顾人或东西。","pronunciation":["아끼다"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢，喜爱","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"希望享受着做。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1bc355425cc2a8e04fc3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.856,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31695","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你真的很重视并喜爱我们的传统文化啊。","我打算用传统方式举办婚礼。","我们中秋节参加跳板游戏比赛吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我打算用传统方式举办婚礼。","我们中秋节参加跳板游戏比赛吧？","你真的很重视并喜爱我们的传统文化啊。"],"answer":2}]}
